{
  "levels": ["minimal", "standard", "full"],
  "default_level": "standard",
  "labels": {"minimal": "简洁", "standard": "标准", "full": "详细"},
  "rules": [
    "Presentation only: every level reads the same snapshot items; nothing is sent to the host.",
    "standard: the existing process grouping (apps/ios RemoteTranscript.groups). Tool steps, reasoning, file_changed and finished-turn commentary fold into one process row; result tools and assistant resources stay outside.",
    "minimal: start from standard rows. Drop every process row whose failures count is 0; replace the others with one failures row. Also drop usage items. Live commentary stays visible as progress text; the existing running indicator stays.",
    "full: one item row per snapshot item, in order, with tool and reasoning content shown expanded.",
    "Row kinds: item {index}; process {indices, tools, files, failures}; failures {indices, count}. indices point into the case's items."
  ],
  "cases": [
    {
